    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.direction.marian.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.eve.marian.asset.sprite.marian",
        "actorId": "marian",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "前夜祭を、救護のマリアンと回ることになった。回る、と言っても、彼女の歩みはゆっくりだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "屋台のたびに、火傷しそうな子どもと、転びそうな酔客を、目だけで数えている。癖なのだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "去年まで、休むことを許されなかった人だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今年の彼女は、休止札を胸に下げて、堂々と祭りを歩いている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今夜は、非番です」三回目に言うときが、いちばん嬉しそうだった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "りんご飴を半分こして、通りの外れのベンチに座った。夜風が、思ったより冷たい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日の柿落としの話をするうち、私の指先が、少しずつ冷えていった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "緊張は、いつも指から来る。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "マリアンは、めざとい。「手、冷えてますね」彼女の手のひらが、光りかけて——止まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "一度、二度、三度目で、光は完全に消えた。治さない練習の、成果なのだ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "代わりに、彼女はただ、私の手を両手で包んだ。「緊張は、怪我じゃないので。治しません」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……ぬくもりだけが、ゆっくり移ってくる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "力を使えば一瞬のことを、彼女はわざわざ、時間をかけてやる。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「治すとね、ミミ。無かったことに、なっちゃうんです」初めて、名前だけで呼ばれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、きゅっと熱くなる。「明日の緊張は、無かったことにしたくないでしょう?」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「大事な日の、証拠だから」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "はい、と返事をしたら、少し声が湿った。それも治さないでもらえるのが、今夜は、ありがたい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二人ぶんの息が白くなって、夜店の灯りの中へ混ざっていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "別れぎわ、彼女は休止札を裏返して見せた。裏には、小さな字で「明日は、特等席で観ます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.marian.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……救護席ではなく、特等席。それが、どれだけ大きな進歩か、私は知っている。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.marian.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
    "status": "review",
